  <title type="title-main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Characteristics of a bending-loss insensitive single-mode optical fibre and cable for the access network</title>
  <title type="main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Characteristics of a bending-loss insensitive single-mode optical fibre and cable for the access network</title>
